@guide H_Ashenvale
@name Ashenvale (Splintertree Post)
@faction Horde
@levels 23-28
@zone Ashenvale
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Zoram'gar Outpost, Splintertree Post and the Warsong Lumber Camp. The Ashenvale Hunt and Blackfathom Deeps are optional.
@next H_Hillsbrad

